Package: ebw
Type: Package
Title: Energy Balancing and Independence Weights for Binary and Continuous Treatments
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jared", "Huling",  role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jaredhuling@gmail.com")
    )
Description: Estimation of covariate balancing weights for causal inference with
    either a binary treatment, through energy balancing weights, or a continuous
    treatment, through independence weights. Both weightings solve a
    simplex-constrained ridge quadratic program whose dual representation yields
    a balancing function that extends to new covariate values, so a fitted
    weighting can predict the weight a new unit would receive out of sample.
